# Credential material — defence in depth, NOT a credential store.
#
# Credentials belong OUTSIDE this repository entirely (see SECURITY.md and
# docs/security-operations.md). These rules are narrow and targeted on
# purpose: broad patterns like `*Documentation/` or `*.rtf` would silently
# hide legitimate Baxter material, and a rule that hides real work is worse
# than no rule. Anything matched here should not have been in the working
# tree in the first place.
recovery-codes*
*recovery-codes*
credentials.*
*-credentials.*
secrets.*
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
id_rsa*
.netrc
.npmrc
